WEBVTT

00:11:58.413 --> 00:12:00.150
Još jedna odlična vest za nas

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.046
je to što ovako možemo promeniti

00:12:02.046 --> 00:12:04.367
američki pravosudni sistem.

00:12:04.367 --> 00:12:06.724
Tako naše ulice možemo
učiniti bezbednijima,

00:12:06.724 --> 00:12:09.023
možemo smanjiti troškove zatvora,

00:12:09.023 --> 00:12:11.090
i sam sistem može postati pravedniji

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.815
i puno više fer.

00:12:12.815 --> 00:12:14.977
Neki to zovu naukom o podacima.

00:12:14.977 --> 00:12:17.278
Ja to zovem Manibol pravosudni sistem.

00:12:17.278 --> 00:12:19.082
Hvala vam.

00:12:19.082 --> 00:12:23.175
(Aplauz)